**Survey Paper Retrieval System with Automatic Keyword Extraction**

Developed a research-based project to improve the efficiency of retrieving relevant survey papers through automatic keyword extraction techniques. The system analyzes research documents, extracts important keywords automatically, and uses them to improve search and retrieval accuracy. Implemented data preprocessing, text analysis, and information retrieval concepts to reduce manual searching effort and provide faster access to relevant academic resources. The project focuses on improving research productivity, search optimization, and delivering accurate results for academic and analytical applications. This work also enhanced practical knowledge in Data Science, text processing, data analysis, and machine learning-based information retrieval approaches.
